1	//! Filesystem projection: rendering state to markdown under `.panopt/`.
2	//!
3	//! Every write goes through [`atomic_write`] - write to a temp file in the same
4	//! directory, then `rename` over the target - so a reader (an editor, the
5	//! Zellij plugin) never observes a half-written file.
6	//!
7	//! Todos project as one file per todo under `.panopt/todos/<id>.md`, each a
8	//! self-contained record with a `---` frontmatter block of structured fields
9	//! and a markdown body, plus a `.panopt/todos.md` index linking them all.
10	
11	use std::collections::HashSet;
